{% comment %}
  Branded STL cover — dark background, mono kicker, Archivo title, signal
  badge tag. Used on the STL product page hero, STL product/collection
  cards, and (in 'micro' size) the STL cart line thumbnail.

  LAUNCH BLOCKER (temporary content, not a design change): the approved
  design's badge text is "INSTANT DOWNLOAD" (Handoff §G), but Digital
  Downloads isn't installed yet, so nothing is actually delivered
  instantly today. Defaults to "DIGITAL FILE" until that app is connected
  — see docs/commerce.md and LAUNCH-BLOCKERS.md. Revert the `badge`
  default below to 'INSTANT DOWNLOAD' once fulfillment is real; every
  caller that doesn't pass an explicit `badge` picks up the fix in one
  place.

  Usage:
  {% render 'eh-stl-cover', title: product.title, size: 'full', title_size: 'lg', ratio: '1' %}

  Params:
    title       — text shown as the cover title (full size only)
    size        — 'full' (default) | 'micro' (small square thumbnail, no title/kicker)
    title_size  — 'sm' | 'md' | 'lg', default 'md' (full size only)
    ratio       — CSS aspect-ratio value, default '1'
    badge       — badge text (full size only), default 'DIGITAL FILE'
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign eh_size = size | default: 'full'
  assign eh_title_size = title_size | default: 'md'
  assign eh_ratio = ratio | default: '1'
  assign eh_badge = badge | default: 'DIGITAL FILE'
-%}
<div class="eh-stl-cover eh-stl-cover--{{ eh_size }}" style="aspect-ratio: {{ eh_ratio }};">
  {%- if eh_size == 'micro' -%}
    <span class="eh-spec eh-stl-cover__micro-label">STL</span>
  {%- else -%}
    <span class="eh-spec eh-stl-cover__kicker">EVERHAVEN · STL</span>
    {%- if title != blank -%}
      <span class="eh-stl-cover__title eh-stl-cover__title--{{ eh_title_size }}">{{ title | escape }}</span>
    {%- endif -%}
    <span class="eh-spec eh-stl-cover__badge">{{ eh_badge | escape }}</span>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
